{"id":1388,"date":"2026-08-22T21:27:15","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T21:27:15","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1388"},"modified":"2026-08-22T21:39:40","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T21:39:40","slug":"zoom-controls","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/zoom-controls\/","title":{"rendered":"Zoom Controls"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Zoom Controls<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1397\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ZoomControls.webp\" alt=\"Zoom Controls\" width=\"70\" height=\"73\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ZoomControls.webp 933w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ZoomControls-288x300.webp 288w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ZoomControls-768x799.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 70px) 100vw, 70px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The zoom level is shown in the bottom-right corner of the workspace. A zoom slider allows smooth, continuous zoom from 10% all the way to 500%, giving you precise control over how much of your canvas is visible at any time.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Keyboard Shortcuts<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1395\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/KeyboardHelp.webp\" alt=\"Keyboard Shortcuts\" width=\"228\" height=\"111\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/KeyboardHelp.webp 517w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/KeyboardHelp-300x146.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 228px) 100vw, 228px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">F9<\/span> &#8211;<\/strong> Toggles between your current zoom level and 100% actual size. Pressing again returns to your previous zoom.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">Ctrl + Shift + L<\/span> &#8211;<\/strong> Whole Page View: instantly zooms to fit the entire page within the window.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">Ctrl + Shift + O<\/span> &#8211;<\/strong> Toggles element boundary boxes on and off.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Quick Zoom Presets<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1391\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222619.png\" alt=\"Multi-Page View\" width=\"466\" height=\"304\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222619.png 1184w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222619-300x196.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222619-1024x668.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222619-768x501.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 466px) 100vw, 466px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Right-click the zoom slider to open a context menu with instant one-click access to common zoom levels: 60%, 70%, 80%, 90%, 100%, 110%, 120%, 130%, 150%, 175%, and 200%.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Multi-Page View<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">When the zoom level drops below 45% and your document has more than one page, Open Publisher automatically switches to <strong>Multi-Page View<\/strong>, rendering all pages side-by-side in the workspace.<\/p>\n<p class=\"western\">Read-only preview clones of all non-active pages appear alongside the live editable page. Click any preview page to switch to editing it instantly &#8211; without leaving multi-page view.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1392 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222700.png\" alt=\"Zoom Slider\" width=\"1387\" height=\"165\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222700.png 1387w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222700-300x36.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222700-1024x122.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-22-222700-768x91.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1387px) 100vw, 1387px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Zoom Controls The zoom level is shown in the bottom-right corner of the workspace. A zoom slider allows smooth, continuous zoom from 10% all the way to 500%, giving you precise control over how much of your canvas is visible at any time. Keyboard Shortcuts F9 &#8211; Toggles between your current zoom level and 100% [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1397,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-1388","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1388","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1388"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1388\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1399,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1388\/revisions\/1399"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1397"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1388"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1388"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}